      "id": "graphics-uphcsdp-ii",
      "title": "UPHCSDP-II",
      "description": "The Urban Primary Health Care Services Delivery Project (UPHCSDP-II) aimed to improve access to essential primary healthcare services, particularly for women, children and underserved urban communities. As part of the project, a social media campaign was carried out from January to June 2024 to raise awareness about maternal, newborn and child health, promote essential healthcare practices and communicate important public health information.\n\nThe campaign featured a series of informative social media graphics covering topics such as antenatal care, safe delivery, immunisation and newborn care, presenting health information in an accessible and engaging format.\n\nMy Contribution: Contributed to the planning and development of the social media campaign, including communication planning and coordination of visual content.",
